# Concept DOI only. It always resolves to the newest release, so it never goes
# stale. A version DOI is deliberately not listed here: Zenodo mints it only
# after the tag is archived, so any value committed before a release is by
# construction the previous release's, which is how this file and coxstream's
# both drifted. Cite the concept DOI; Zenodo shows the per-version DOIs.
